      "Enhancement§Soul-shattering Charge (Upgrade)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Cavalcade Of Chaos"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Upgrade"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 10
          }
        },
        "text": "**LEGIONES DAEMONICA MOUNTED** unit only. When this unit is **selected to fight**, if this unit made a **charge move** this turn, you can use this ability. If you do, when determining which models in this unit can fight, friendly models that are within 3\" of enemy units **engaged** with this unit can target those enemy units.",
        "removed": {
          "keywords": {
