      },
      "Stratagem§Rapturous Agony": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH** unit (excluding **MONSTER/VEHICLE** units).\n\n**TARGET:** That **LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Attacks that target your unit with a **S** greater than your unit’s **T** have -1 to wound rolls.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Legion of Excess"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
            "Command",
            "Fight",
            "Movement",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Inescapable Manifestations": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, when a unit is selected to make a **fall-back move**, if that unit is **engaged** with a friendly **LEGIONES DAEMONICA MOUNTED** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **LEGIONES DAEMONICA MOUNTED** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** When an enemy unit **engaged** with your unit is selected to make a **fall-back move**, that enemy unit must use the **desperate escape mode**. If that enemy unit is **battle-shocked**, -1 from those **hazard rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Cavalcade Of Chaos"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Warp-riders": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **LEGIONES DAEMONICA MOUNTED** unit is **selected to move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **LEGIONES DAEMONICA MOUNTED** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has **MOBILE**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Cavalcade Of Chaos"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Soulseeing": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **LEGIONES DAEMONICA BATTLELINE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one **visible** enemy unit within 12\" of your unit. That enemy unit has +6\" **detection range**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Warptide"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Incorporeal Entities": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **LEGIONES DAEMONICA BATTLELINE** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **LEGIONES DAEMONICA BATTLELINE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Ranged attacks that target your unit with a **S** greater than your unit’s **T** have -1 to **wound rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Warptide"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Daemonic Infestation": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **LEGIONES DAEMONICA BATTLELINE** unit (excluding **PINK HORRORS** units).\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit **heals** 3 wounds.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Warptide"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Bilious Blessing": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **LEGIONES DAEMONICA CHARACTER NURGLE** unit (excluding **MONSTER** units).\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one **visible** enemy unit within 8\" of your unit and roll seven D6:\n\n- For each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 **mortal wound**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Lords Of The Warp"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Carnival of Excess": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when an enemy unit has **fought**.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **LEGIONES DAEMONICA CHARACTER SLAANESH** unit (excluding **MONSTER** units) that has not been **selected to fight** this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has **Fights First** and must be the next unit you **select to fight**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Lords Of The Warp"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Call to Murder": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **LEGIONES DAEMONICA KHORNE CHARACTER** unit (excluding **MONSTER** units) that made a **charge move** this turn is **selected to fight**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **LEGIONES DAEMONICA CHARACTER KHORNE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s melee attacks have +1 **A**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Lords Of The Warp"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Skirling Magicks": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **LEGIONES DAEMONICA CHARACTER TZEENTCH** unit (excluding **MONSTER** units) is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **LEGIONES DAEMONICA CHARACTER TZEENTCH** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s ranged attacks have **[LETHAL HITS]**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Lords Of The Warp"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§From Beyond the Veil": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of the Movement phase, from the start of the battle.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **LEGIONES DAEMONICA MOUNTED** unit in **strategic reserves**.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make an **ingress move**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Legiones Daemonica",
            "Cavalcade Of Chaos"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
