      "The Great Game§The Great Game": {
        "assets": {
          "traits": [
            "Dark God§Khorne",
            "Dark God§Tzeentch",
            "Dark God§Nurgle",
            "Dark God§Slaanesh"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Chaos Daemons use the 9th edition codex's Crusade rules until an 11e Crusade section is published.\n\nIf your Crusade army includes any LEGIONES DAEMONICA units, you can track what influence their actions have on the Great Game, the eternal battle between the Dark Gods for primacy. When you are creating your Order of Battle, if it includes any LEGIONES DAEMONICA units, you can also start to influence the Great Game. During your battles, if your army roster includes any LEGIONES DAEMONICA units, you will gain Ascendancy points for each of the four gods - Khorne, Tzeentch, Nurgle and Slaanesh. At the end of each battle, you will recalculate each god's total Ascendancy points and organise them into a hierarchy, from first to fourth position. Each god will gain new benefits based on their position in the Great Game, that you can use for LEGIONES DAEMONICA units on your Order of Battle with their Allegiance keyword. After 8 battles, that round of the Great Game will be complete, and your forces will gain additional rewards depending on their god’s final position in that round. At the end of each round, after gaining these rewards, each Dark God’s Ascendancy points total will be reset based on their final position in the previous round.\n\n\n\nBeginning the Great Game: Khorne 4 Ascendancy points, Tzeentch 3, Nurgle 2, Slaanesh 1. The god with the most Ascendancy points is in first position, the god with the second most in second position and so forth down to fourth position. Each god is also considered to have their own Allegiance keyword.\n\n\n\nGaining Ascendancy Points: At the end of each battle, each of the Dark Gods gains Ascendancy points in the following order: Khorne, Tzeentch, Nurgle, Slaanesh. Each god gains D3 Ascendancy points. The god that shares an Allegiance keyword with your WARLORD gains 1 Ascendancy point, or D3 if you won the battle (if BE’LAKOR was your WARLORD, all four gods gain 1 each, or D3 each if you won). If, after a god has gained Ascendancy points, they have the same total as another god, the god you have just rolled for gains 1 additional Ascendancy point.\n\n\n\nThe Positions. First position (Dominion): add 1 to the Leadership characteristic of models in LEGIONES DAEMONICA units from your army that share an Allegiance keyword with that Dark God; once per battle, you can use an Epic Deed Stratagem for 0CP if the unit selected for that Stratagem shares an Allegiance keyword with that Dark God. Second position: add 1 to the Leadership characteristic of models in LEGIONES DAEMONICA ICON units from your army that share an Allegiance keyword with that Dark God; once per battle, if your WARLORD shares an Allegiance keyword with that Dark God, you can use the Command Re-roll Core Stratagem for 0CP. Third position: no additional abilities. Fourth position: subtract 1 from the Leadership characteristic of models in LEGIONES DAEMONICA ICON units from your army that share an Allegiance keyword with that Dark God; each time a model in a LEGIONES DAEMONICA unit from your army that shares an Allegiance keyword with that Dark God makes an attack against an enemy unit that shares an Allegiance keyword with one of the Dark Gods in first, second or third position, you can re-roll the hit roll.\n\n\n\nEnd of a Round (after 8 battles): First position: every unit on your Order of Battle that shares an Allegiance keyword with this Dark God gains 3 experience points; one GREATER DAEMON of that god gains 1 Exalted, Greater or Lesser Favoured Reward. Second position: 2 experience points; one GREATER DAEMON gains 1 Greater or Lesser Reward. Third position: 1 experience point; one GREATER DAEMON gains 1 Lesser Reward. Fourth position: there are no rewards for failure! The Next Round: each Dark God starts the next round with First 4, Second 3, Third 2, Fourth 1 Ascendancy points.\n\n"
      },
      "Locus of the Gods§Locus of Unstoppable Fury (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Khorne"
          ]
        },
        "text": "KHORNE model only. While a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA KHORNE CORE unit is within range of this ability, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, an unmodified hit roll of 6 automatically wounds the target."
      },
      "Locus of the Gods§Locus of Diabolical Purpose (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Khorne"
          ]
        },
        "text": "KHORNE model only. While a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA KHORNE CORE unit is within range of this ability, each time that unit makes a consolidation move, models in that unit can move an additional 3\"."
      },
      "Locus of the Gods§Locus of Conjuration (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Tzeentch"
          ]
        },
        "text": "TZEENTCH model only. While a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA TZEENTCH PSYKER unit is within range of this ability, each time a Psychic test is taken for that unit, you can re-roll any or all dice rolls of 1-2."
      },
      "Locus of the Gods§Locus of Transmogrification (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Tzeentch"
          ]
        },
        "text": "TZEENTCH model only. While a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA TZEENTCH CORE unit is within range of this ability, each time a model in that unit would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 6, that wound is not lost."
      },
      "Locus of the Gods§Locus of Poxes Uncounted (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Nurgle"
          ]
        },
        "text": "NURGLE model only. While a friendly PLAGUEBEARERS CORE unit is within range of this ability, you can re-roll charge rolls made for that unit."
      },
      "Locus of the Gods§Locus of Foetid Regeneration (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Nurgle"
          ]
        },
        "text": "NURGLE model only. While a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE CORE unit is within range of this ability, each time an attack is allocated to a model in that unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack (to a minimum of 1)."
      },
      "Locus of the Gods§Locus of Delicate Evisceration (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Slaanesh"
          ]
        },
        "text": "SLAANESH model only. While a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH CORE unit is within range of this ability, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Locus of the Gods§Locus of Unnatural Swiftness (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Slaanesh"
          ]
        },
        "text": "SLAANESH model only. While a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH CORE unit is within range of this ability, that unit is eligible to charge, even if it Advanced in the same turn."
      },
      "Favoured Reward§Avatar of Unreality": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": []
        },
        "text": "Lesser Reward. Each time you make a Warp Storm roll, if this model is on the battlefield, roll 1 additional D6.",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "Favoured Reward§Empyric Beacon": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": []
        },
        "text": "Lesser Reward. This model has the WARP LOCUS keyword.",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "Favoured Reward§Favoured Followers": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": []
        },
        "text": "Lesser Reward. Each time you add a LEGIONES DAEMONICA CORE unit to your Order of Battle, you can remove up to 3 Ascendancy points from the Dark God that shares an Allegiance keyword with that unit. If you do so, that LEGIONES DAEMONICA CORE unit immediately gains a number of experience points equal to twice the number of Ascendancy points removed.",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "Favoured Reward§Infernal Mark": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": []
        },
        "text": "Greater Reward. If this model is a TZEENTCH, NURGLE or SLAANESH model, this model knows one additional psychic power from any discipline they have access to, and once per battle, after successfully manifesting a psychic power, this model can regain up to D3 lost wounds. If this model is a KHORNE model, add 1 to that model’s Strength characteristic, and once per battle, after this model destroys an enemy CHARACTER model with a melee attack, this model can regain up to D3 lost wounds.",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "Favoured Reward§Portal Keeper": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": []
        },
        "text": "Greater Reward. If this model is part of your Crusade force and you are the Attacker, then you start the battle with an additional 2 Command points. If this model is part of your Crusade force and you are using the Strategic Reserves rule, you can halve the Command point cost required to place units into Strategic Reserves (rounding down).",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "Favoured Reward§Crown of Conquests": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": []
        },
        "text": "Greater Reward. Once per battle, if this model is on the battlefield, you can use one Battle Tactic or Strategic Ploy Stratagem twice during the same phase, instead of only once. When you select this model to be your WARLORD, you receive 1 additional Command point.",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "Favoured Reward§Slayer of Kings": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": []
        },
        "text": "Exalted Reward. Each time this model makes an attack against an enemy WARLORD or a unit that has a higher Crusade points total than this model, add 1 to that attack’s wound roll. Each time this model destroys an enemy WARLORD or a unit that has a higher Crusade points total than this model, it gains 1 additional experience point at the end of the battle.",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "Favoured Reward§Lord of the Storm": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": []
        },
        "text": "Exalted Reward. If this model is your WARLORD, and the Warp Storm ability is in effect, while this model is on the battlefield: each time you make a Warp Storm roll, roll 1 additional D6; once per battle round, when you use a Warp Storm effect, reduce the Warp Storm points cost of that effect by 1.",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "Favoured Reward§Exalted Servant": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": []
        },
        "text": "Exalted Reward. You can use the Exalted Daemon Requisition once for 0RP, but if you do so, you must select this model. If this model is not eligible for that Requisition it cannot be given this Reward. When you do so, that Requisition can be used to give this model an additional Exalted ability. You cannot use this ability if doing so would cause your Crusade force to exceed its Supply Limit.",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "Battle Trait§Aspiring Skull-Takers": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Bloodletters"
          ]
        },
        "text": "BLOODLETTERS unit only. Each time an attack made by models in this unit destroys an enemy CHARACTER unit, subtract 2 from that CHARACTER unit’s Out of Action test at the end of the battle."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Brazen Sinews": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Bloodletters"
          ]
        },
        "text": "BLOODLETTERS unit only. Add 1 to the Strength characteristic of models in this unit."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Unquenchable Bloodthirst": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Bloodletters"
          ]
        },
        "text": "BLOODLETTERS unit only. Each time this unit is selected for the Frenetic Bloodlust Stratagem, that Stratagem costs 1 fewer CPs to use (to a minimum of 0CP)."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Expert Flamecasters": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Horrors"
          ]
        },
        "text": "HORRORS unit only. Improve the Ballistic Skill characteristic of models in this unit by 1."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Shatterselves": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Horrors"
          ]
        },
        "text": "HORRORS unit only. Out of Action tests taken for this unit are automatically passed."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Fires of Tzeentch": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Horrors"
          ]
        },
        "text": "HORRORS unit only. Each time this unit is selected for the Minions of Magic Stratagem, that Stratagem costs 1 fewer CPs to use (to a minimum of 0CP)."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Noisome Odour (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Plaguebearers"
          ]
        },
        "text": "PLAGUEBEARERS unit only. While an enemy unit is within 3\" of this unit, subtract 1 from Combat Attrition tests taken for that enemy unit."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Encrusted Scabs": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Plaguebearers"
          ]
        },
        "text": "PLAGUEBEARERS unit only. Models in this unit have a Daemonic Save characteristic of 4+/4+."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Disgusting Resilience": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Plaguebearers"
          ]
        },
        "text": "PLAGUEBEARERS unit only. Each time this unit is selected for the Revolting Constitution Stratagem, that Stratagem costs 1 fewer CPs to use (to a minimum of 0CP)."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Perfect Killers": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Daemonettes"
          ]
        },
        "text": "DAEMONETTES unit only. Each time you make a Warp Storm roll, if any enemy units were destroyed by an attack made by this unit in the previous battle round, roll one additional D6."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Whimsic Wisps": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Daemonettes"
          ]
        },
        "text": "DAEMONETTES unit only. Each time a model in this unit makes a melee attack, the target does not receive the benefits of cover against that attack."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Claws of Living Diamond": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Daemonettes"
          ]
        },
        "text": "DAEMONETTES unit only. Each time this unit is selected for the Razor-sharp Caress Stratagem, that Stratagem costs 1 fewer CPs to use (to a minimum of 0CP)."
      },
