        "text": "KHORNE model equipped with an axe of Khorne only. This Relic replaces an axe of Khorne: Mighty strike (Melee, S +4, AP -4, D D6) or Sweeping blow (Melee, S User, AP -3, D 1; make 2 hit rolls instead of 1). When the bearer is destroyed, instead of using any rules that are triggered when that model is destroyed, you can replace it with a BLOODTHIRSTER model that uses the Bloodthirster datasheet, is treated as a named character and has no Warlord Trait or Crusade card. At the end of each subsequent Fight phase, roll one D6 for this model: on a 5+, the axe’s power ensnares it again and it is removed from the battlefield.",
